---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Scott Tang – About">
	<section class="page about-page">
		<div class="page-title-row">
			<div class="page-title-left">
				<h1>About</h1>
			</div>
			
		</div>

		<div class="about-content">
			<div class="about-text">
				<!-- About / Education + Experience -->
				<div class="about-section about-intro">
					<div class="about-col">
						<p>I'm Scott!, a senior studying <strong>Computer Science (Games)</strong> at the <span class="usc">University of Southern California</span> and plan to pursue graduate study.</p>
						<p>At <span class="usc">USC</span>, I engaged in the <strong>game community</strong> actively and spent years with Chinese Students and Scholars Association<strong>(CSSA)</strong>, helping Chinese students feel at home on campus.</p>
					</div>
					<span class="intro-deco-icon" aria-hidden="true">
						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="6" x2="10" y1="11" y2="11"/><line x1="8" x2="8" y1="9" y2="13"/><line x1="15" x2="15.01" y1="12" y2="12"/><line x1="18" x2="18.01" y1="10" y2="10"/><path d="M17.32 5H6.68a4 4 0 0 0-3.978 3.59c-.006.052-.01.101-.017.152C2.604 9.416 2 14.456 2 16a3 3 0 0 0 3 3c1 0 1.5-.5 2-1l1.414-1.414A2 2 0 0 1 9.828 16h4.344a2 2 0 0 1 1.414.586L17 18c.5.5 1 1 2 1a3 3 0 0 0 3-3c0-1.545-.604-6.584-.685-7.258-.007-.05-.011-.1-.017-.151A4 4 0 0 0 17.32 5z"/></svg>
					</span>
					<div class="about-col">
						<p>Last summer, I interned at <strong>ByteDance</strong>, where I developed tools connecting Unity and an internal engine. Before that, I was at NetEase Games as game designer. Here is my <a href="/about/Scott-Tang-resume.pdf" class="about-link">resume</a>.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Image gallery: between intro and interests (3 photos, square crop = trim) -->
			<div class="about-gallery" aria-label="Photos">
				<div class="about-gallery-item">
					<img src="/about/photo-1.jpg" alt="At a cafe with a birdcage" width="400" height="400" />
				</div>
				<div class="about-gallery-item">
					<img src="/about/photo-2.jpg" alt="With friends outdoors" width="400" height="400" />
				</div>
				<div class="about-gallery-item">
					<img src="/about/photo-3.jpg" alt="In front of Manhattan Bridge" width="400" height="400" />
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="about-text">
				<!-- Interests -->
				<div class="about-section about-interests">
				<div class="about-col">
					<p>I'm especially fascinated by how rendering, engine systems, and gameplay logic come together to create game worlds. Ever since I was young, I've had a habit of pulling things apart just to understand how they work, and that curiosity still drives most of what I do.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="about-col">
					<p>In my spare time, I enjoy single-player games, especially the quiet process of figuring out systems and experiencing the story. I'm also a huge soccer fan — <strong><span class="visca">Visca</span> <span class="barca">Barça</span></strong>! When I'm not behind a screen you'll probably find me at the gym.</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Contact -->
			<div class="about-section about-contact">
				<h2 class="about-heading">Contact</h2>
				<p>I'm always happy to hear from new people. Feel free to reach out and say hello!</p>
				<p>You can find me on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/ruiscott_39/" class="about-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a>, <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/scott-tang-gl/" class="about-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>, and <a href="https://github.com/ttocs778" class="about-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>. Or contact me directly via <strong>Email</strong>, <strong>Phone</strong>, or <strong>WeChat</strong>.</p>
				<p>
					Email: <span class="inline-code">ruitang591@gmail.com</span><br />
					Phone: <span class="inline-code">747-222-0001</span><br />
					WeChat ID: <span class="inline-code">ruiscott_39</span>
				</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Gaming: Steam, PSN, Battle.net -->
			<div class="about-section about-gaming">
				<h2 class="about-heading about-gaming-heading">Gaming</h2>
				<p class="about-gaming-subtitle">Let's play together!</p>
				<div class="about-gaming-grid">
					<!-- Steam -->
					<div class="about-gaming-panel about-gaming-panel--steam">
						<h3 class="about-gaming-platform-name">Steam</h3>
						<span class="about-gaming-panel-label">Recently played</span>
						<div id="steam-recent-list" class="about-gaming-recent-list" aria-live="polite">
							<span class="about-gaming-recent-placeholder">—</span>
						</div>
						<a href="https://steamcommunity.com/id/Scottisidiot" class="about-gaming-cta about-gaming-cta--steam" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Add me on Steam</a>
					</div>
					<!-- PlayStation: replace href with your PSN profile URL if you have one -->
					<div class="about-gaming-panel about-gaming-panel--psn">
						<h3 class="about-gaming-platform-name">PlayStation</h3>
						<span class="about-gaming-panel-label">Recently played</span>
						<div class="about-gaming-recent-list">
							<span class="about-gaming-recent-placeholder">—</span>
						</div>
						<a href="https://my.playstation.com/profile/ReplaceWithYourPSNID" class="about-gaming-cta about-gaming-cta--psn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Add me on PlayStation</a>
					</div>
					<!-- Battle.net: static recently played list -->
					<div class="about-gaming-panel about-gaming-panel--battlenet">
						<h3 class="about-gaming-platform-name">Battle.net</h3>
						<span class="about-gaming-panel-label">Recently played</span>
						<div class="about-gaming-recent-list">
							<a href="https://overwatch.blizzard.com/en-us/" class="about-gaming-game" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View Overwatch">
								<span class="about-gaming-game-icon" aria-hidden="true">
									<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="6" x2="10" y1="11" y2="11"/><line x1="8" x2="8" y1="9" y2="13"/><line x1="15" x2="15.01" y1="12" y2="12"/><line x1="18" x2="18.01" y1="10" y2="10"/><path d="M17.32 5H6.68a4 4 0 0 0-3.978 3.59c-.006.052-.01.101-.017.152C2.604 9.416 2 14.456 2 16a3 3 0 0 0 3 3c1 0 1.5-.5 2-1l1.414-1.414A2 2 0 0 1 9.828 16h4.344a2 2 0 0 1 1.414.586L17 18c.5.5 1 1 2 1a3 3 0 0 0 3-3c0-1.545-.604-6.584-.685-7.258-.007-.05-.011-.1-.017-.151A4 4 0 0 0 17.32 5z"/></svg>
								</span>
								<div class="about-gaming-game-text">
									<span class="about-gaming-game-name">Overwatch</span>
									<span class="about-gaming-game-stats">600 hrs total</span>
								</div>
							</a>
						</div>
						<button type="button" class="about-gaming-cta about-gaming-cta--battlenet about-gaming-cta--copy" data-battletag="SORU#31904">Copy my Battle.net id</button>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<script>
		(async () => {
			const container = document.getElementById('steam-recent-list');
			if (!container) return;
			const placeholder = container.querySelector('.about-gaming-recent-placeholder');
			try {
				const res = await fetch('/api/steam-recent');
				const { games } = await res.json();
				if (games && games.length > 0) {
					if (placeholder) placeholder.remove();
					const oneGame = games.slice(0, 1);
					container.append(
						...oneGame.map((g: { appid: number; name: string; playtime_forever?: number }) => {
							const link = document.createElement('a');
							link.href = `https://store.steampowered.com/app/${g.appid}`;
							link.target = '_blank';
							link.rel = 'noopener noreferrer';
							link.className = 'about-gaming-game';
							link.setAttribute('aria-label', `View ${g.name} on Steam`);
							const icon = document.createElement('span');
							icon.className = 'about-gaming-game-icon';
							icon.innerHTML = '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="6" x2="10" y1="11" y2="11"/><line x1="8" x2="8" y1="9" y2="13"/><line x1="15" x2="15.01" y1="12" y2="12"/><line x1="18" x2="18.01" y1="10" y2="10"/><path d="M17.32 5H6.68a4 4 0 0 0-3.978 3.59c-.006.052-.01.101-.017.152C2.604 9.416 2 14.456 2 16a3 3 0 0 0 3 3c1 0 1.5-.5 2-1l1.414-1.414A2 2 0 0 1 9.828 16h4.344a2 2 0 0 1 1.414.586L17 18c.5.5 1 1 2 1a3 3 0 0 0 3-3c0-1.545-.604-6.584-.685-7.258-.007-.05-.011-.1-.017-.151A4 4 0 0 0 17.32 5z"/></svg>';
							const title = document.createElement('span');
							title.className = 'about-gaming-game-name';
							title.textContent = g.name;
							const totalHrs = Math.round((g.playtime_forever || 0) / 60);
							const stats = document.createElement('span');
							stats.className = 'about-gaming-game-stats';
							stats.textContent = `${totalHrs} hrs total`;
							const textBlock = document.createElement('div');
							textBlock.className = 'about-gaming-game-text';
							textBlock.appendChild(title);
							textBlock.appendChild(stats);
							link.appendChild(icon);
							link.appendChild(textBlock);
							return link;
						})
					);
				} else {
					if (placeholder) placeholder.textContent = 'Nothing in the last 2 weeks';
				}
			} catch {
				if (placeholder) placeholder.textContent = '—';
			}
		})();

		// Copy Battle.net id button
		document.querySelectorAll('.about-gaming-cta--copy').forEach((btn) => {
			btn.addEventListener('click', async () => {
				const tag = btn.getAttribute('data-battletag') || '';
				try {
					await navigator.clipboard.writeText(tag);
					const orig = btn.textContent;
					btn.textContent = 'Copied!';
					setTimeout(() => { btn.textContent = orig; }, 1500);
				} catch {
					btn.textContent = 'Copy failed';
					setTimeout(() => { btn.textContent = 'Copy my Battle.net id'; }, 1500);
				}
			});
		});
	</script>

	<style>
		.page {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 0.75rem;
		}

		h1 {
			margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
			font-size: 1.6rem;
			letter-spacing: 0.001em;
		}

		.page-title-row h1 {
			margin: 0;
			font-size: 3.4rem;
			line-height: 1.2;
			text-transform: none;
		}

		p {
			margin: 0;
			font-size: 1rem;
			line-height: 1.7;
		}

		.about-content {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 2.5rem;
			align-items: center;
			text-align: left;
		}

		.about-text {
			width: min(50rem, calc(0.65 * (100vw - 3.5rem)));
			max-width: 50rem;
			margin-inline: auto;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 2.5rem;
		}

		.about-text .about-section {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
			gap: 2rem 3rem;
			align-items: start;
		}

		.about-text .about-section.about-contact,
		.about-text .about-section.about-music,
		.about-text .about-section.about-gaming {
			display: block;
		}

		/* Intro: right column aligns with second left paragraph */
		.about-section.about-intro {
			position: relative;
			overflow: visible;
			grid-template-rows: auto auto;
		}
		.about-section.about-intro .about-col:first-child {
			grid-row: 1 / 3;
		}
		.about-section.about-intro .about-col:last-child {
			grid-column: 2;
			grid-row: 2;
			align-self: start;
			margin-left: 0;
		}

		
		.intro-deco-icon {
			position: absolute;
			top: -5rem;
			right: 0rem;
			width: 4rem;
			height: 4rem;
			pointer-events: none;
			color: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.35);
			transform: scale(3) rotate(18deg);
			transform-origin: top right;
		}
		.intro-deco-icon svg {
			width: 100%;
			height: 100%;
			display: block;
		}

		.about-section.about-interests .about-col:last-child {
			margin-left: 0;
		}

		.about-section {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
			gap: 2rem 3rem;
			align-items: start;
		}

		.about-col p + p {
			margin-top: 1rem;
		}

		.about-link {
			color: #a5b4fc;
			text-decoration: underline;
			text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
			transition: color 0.2s;
		}

		.about-link:hover {
			color: #c7d2fe;
		}

		.visca {
			color: #f87171;
		}

		.barca {
			color: #60a5fa;
		}

		.usc {
			color: #f87171;
			font-weight: 700;
		}

		.about-gallery {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
			gap: 2.5rem;
			width: min(65rem, calc(0.65 * (100vw - 3.5rem)));
			max-width: 65rem;
			margin-inline: auto;
		}

		.about-gallery-item {
			aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
			border-radius: 32px;
			overflow: hidden;
			border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
			background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
		}

		.about-gallery-item img {
			width: 100%;
			height: 100%;
			object-fit: cover;
			display: block;
		}

		.about-contact,
		.about-music {
			display: block;
			grid-template-columns: unset;
		}

		.about-heading {
			margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
			font-size: 1.25rem;
			font-weight: 700;
			letter-spacing: 0.02em;
			color: #fafafa;
		}

		.about-contact p + p,
		.about-music p + p,
		.about-gaming p + p {
			margin-top: 0rem;
		}

		.about-contact code,
		.about-contact .inline-code {
			font-family: ui-monospace, "Cascadia Code", "Source Code Pro", Menlo, monospace;
			font-size: 0.9em;
			padding: 0.15em 0.4em;
			border-radius: 6px;
			background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.15);
			color: #e2e8f0;
		}

		.about-gaming-block {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 0.35rem;
			padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
			border-radius: 10px;
			background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.1);
			border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2);
			text-decoration: none;
			color: inherit;
			transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
		}

		.about-gaming-block:hover {
			background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
			border-color: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.35);
		}

		.about-gaming-label {
			font-size: 0.8rem;
			text-transform: uppercase;
			letter-spacing: 0.08em;
			color: #94a3b8;
		}

		.about-gaming-id {
			font-family: ui-monospace, "Cascadia Code", "Source Code Pro", Menlo, monospace;
			font-size: 1rem;
			color: #e2e8f0;
		}

		.about-steam-recent,
		.about-gaming-recent-list {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 0.75rem;
			margin-top: 0.25rem;
			margin-bottom: -0.25rem;
		}

		.about-steam-recent-placeholder,
		.about-gaming-recent-placeholder {
			color: #94a3b8;
		}

		/* Game row: whole block is the store link; icon + name + hours */
		/* :global() so styles apply to JS-injected elements (Astro scopes by default) */
		:global(.about-gaming-game) {
			display: flex;
			align-items: flex-start;
			gap: 0.65rem;
			padding: 0.55rem 0.9rem;
			margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
			border-radius: 10px;
			background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4);
			border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.1);
			text-decoration: none;
			color: inherit;
			cursor: pointer;
			transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
		}

		:global(.about-gaming-game:hover) {
			background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.7);
			border-color: rgba(0, 111, 205, 0.45);
			box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 111, 205, 0.2);
			transform: translateY(-2px);
		}

		:global(.about-gaming-game:last-child) {
			margin-bottom: 0;
		}

		:global(.about-gaming-game-text) {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 0.25rem;
			min-width: 0;
			flex: 1;
		}

		:global(.about-gaming-game-name) {
			display: block;
			font-size: 0.95rem;
			font-weight: 600;
			color: #e2e8f0;
			line-height: 1.3;
		}

		:global(.about-gaming-game-stats) {
			display: block;
			font-size: 0.78rem;
			color: #64748b;
			line-height: 1.4;
			margin-top: 0.1rem;
		}

		:global(.about-gaming-game-icon) {
			display: inline-flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			margin-top: 0.2rem;
			padding: 0.35rem;
			color: #006FCD;
			border-radius: 8px;
			flex-shrink: 0;
			transition: color 0.2s;
		}

		:global(.about-gaming-game:hover .about-gaming-game-icon) {
			color: #38bdf8;
		}

		:global(.about-gaming-game-icon svg) {
			display: block;
		}

		/* Static game row (no link) – same look, no hover lift/cursor */
		:global(.about-gaming-game--static) {
			cursor: default;
			pointer-events: none;
		}
		:global(.about-gaming-game--static:hover) {
			transform: none;
			background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4);
			border-color: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.1);
			box-shadow: none;
		}

		/* CTAs: platform-colored */
		.about-gaming-cta {
			display: inline-flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			margin-top: 1.25rem;
			padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
			font-size: 0.9rem;
			font-weight: 600;
			font-family: inherit;
			color: #fff;
			border: none;
			border-radius: 8px;
			text-decoration: none;
			cursor: pointer;
			transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
		}

		.about-gaming-cta:hover {
			transform: translateY(-2px);
		}

		.about-gaming-cta--steam {
			background: linear-gradient(135deg, #006FCD 0%, #005299 100%);
			box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 111, 205, 0.4);
		}
		.about-gaming-cta--steam:hover {
			box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 111, 205, 0.5);
		}

		.about-gaming-cta--psn {
			background: linear-gradient(135deg, #006FCD 0%, #005299 100%);
			box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 111, 205, 0.4);
		}
		.about-gaming-cta--psn:hover {
			box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 111, 205, 0.5);
		}

		.about-gaming-cta--battlenet {
			background: linear-gradient(135deg, #006FCD 0%, #005299 100%);
			box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 111, 205, 0.4);
		}
		.about-gaming-cta--battlenet:hover {
			box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 111, 205, 0.5);
		}

		.about-gaming-heading {
			color: #f1f5f9;
			margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		}

		.about-gaming-subtitle {
			margin: 0 0 1rem;
			color: inherit;
			font-size: 1rem;
			line-height: 1.7;
		}

		.about-gaming-grid {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
			gap: 1.25rem;
			width: 100%;
			max-width: 56rem;
			margin-top: 1rem;
			margin-inline: auto;
		}

		@media (max-width: 900px) {
			.about-gaming-grid {
				grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			}
		}

		.about-gaming-intro {
			color: #94a3b8;
			font-size: 0.85rem;
			margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
		}

		.about-gaming-platform-name {
			font-size: 1.15rem;
			font-weight: 700;
			color: #f1f5f9;
			margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
			letter-spacing: 0.02em;
		}

		/* Platform panels: shared dark base + platform accent */
		.about-gaming-panel {
			position: relative;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem 1.5rem;
			border-radius: 16px;
			background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(18, 20, 26, 0.97) 0%, rgba(10, 12, 16, 0.98) 100%);
			border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.15);
			box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
		}

		.about-gaming-panel::before {
			content: '';
			position: absolute;
			top: 0;
			left: 0;
			right: 0;
			height: 3px;
			border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;
